ENTERPRISE TECHNOLOGY TRANSFORMATION PROPOSAL
Prepared by: Abhinav Giri (github.com/abhinavgiri45 | abhinavgiri370@gmail.com)
Product Suite: Giri Orbit (Drift, Axis, Kinetic, Aegis)

1. OPPORTUNITY ASSESSMENT
Current enterprise office suites require multi-gigabyte bloat, continuous internet connections, and send sensitive organizational data to external servers. Giri Orbit provides a 100% sovereign alternative built from scratch in C++.

2. DELIVERABLES
• Giri Drift: Executive document composer with instant typography and universal export.
• Giri Axis: High-velocity matrix with formula evaluation and dynamic multi-sheet modeling.
• Giri Kinetic: Cinematic 16:9 presentation studio with PresentationGo template support.
• Giri Orbit Hub: Centralized launcher and sovereign workspace manager.

3. FINANCIAL & LICENSING TERMS
All installations are perpetual, in-memory, and zero-telemetry.
Contact abhinavgiri370@gmail.com for institutional volume licensing.
